 assembly path: `agentcli/models.go` loads `internal/config.Config`, catalog, discovery cache, then calls `modelregistry.AssembleWithOptions`. Root service routing uses `ServiceConfig` and still builds `routing.Inputs` directly. SD-005 requires `ResolveRoute`, `RouteStatus`, root `ListModels`, and `fiz models` to share the same assembled snapshot.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;CHANGE\u0026#xA;Add a service-side snapshot assembly helper that accepts root `ServiceConfig`, catalog, cache root/refresh policy, and returns `modelregistry.ModelSnapshot` without importing `agentcli`. The helper should preserve ADR-012 stale-while-revalidate/default refresh semantics and make cache root injectable for tests.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;IN-SCOPE FILES\u0026#xA;- internal/modelregistry/ or a new internal service snapshot adapter package\u0026#xA;- internal/config/serviceconfig.go if conversion helpers are needed\u0026#xA;- service_* test fixtures needed for parity\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;OUT-OF-SCOPE\u0026#xA;- Rewriting root `ListModels`.\u0026#xA;- Rewriting `ResolveRoute`.\u0026#xA;- Changing public ServiceConfig methods unless absolutely required and covered by tests.\n    \u003c/description\u003e\n    \u003cacceptance\u003e\n1. `go test ./internal/modelregistry/... -run \u0026#34;ServiceConfig|Snapshot|Assemble\u0026#34; -count=1` passes with fixture coverage proving an equivalent `ServiceConfig` and `internal/config.Config` produce the same provider/model/endpoint rows.\u0026#xA;2. `go test . -run \u0026#34;Test.*Snapshot.*ServiceConfig|Test.*ServiceConfig.*Snapshot\u0026#34; -count=1` passes or the equivalent root package test name added by the implementation passes.\u0026#xA;3. `rg -n \u0026#34;agentcli\u0026#34; internal/modelregistry service_*.go` returns no matches, proving the root service snapshot path does not import CLI code.\n    \u003c/acceptance\u003e\n    \u003clabels\u003earea:service, area:modelregistry, kind:feature, plan-2026-05-12-sd005\u003c/labels\u003e\n    \u003cmetadata parent=\"fizeau-e6145528\" spec-id=\"SD-005\" base-rev=\"4027d22608e61a105ab017ebd56d58347824ff59\" bundle=\".ddx/executions/20260512T195748-2f7bfc16\"/\u003e\n  \u003c/bead\u003e\n  \u003cgoverning\u003e\n    \u003cref id=\"SD-005\" path=\"docs/helix/02-design/solution-designs/SD-005-provider-config.md\"\u003eSolution Design: SD-005 — Provider Sources, Model Catalog, and Power Routing\u003c/ref\u003e\n  \u003c/governing\u003e\n\u003c/execute-bead\u003e\n","metadata":{"DDX_MODE":"bead_execution","attempt_id":"20260512T195748-2f7bfc16","base_rev":"4027d22608e61a105ab017ebd56d58347824ff59","bead_id":"fizeau-ab20bdb8","bundle_path":".ddx/executions/20260512T195748-2f7bfc16","correlation_id":"fizeau-ab20bdb8:20260512T195748-2f7bfc16","prompt_file":".ddx/executions/20260512T195748-2f7bfc16/prompt.md","prompt_sha":"10b312b3d154b60b28c4e454146273688c5d870e9dc25cb2633f35d5c54eac64","role":"implementer","session_id":"eb-382c3e8c","worker_id":""}}}
